      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ。\r\n原因はわからないが\r\n一応調べた方がいいだろう。",
        "official_en": "Yeah, we don’t know what might be the cause, but His Majesty’s right, we better go check it out.",
        "real_en": "Yeah. We don’t know why, but we should look into it anyway."
      },
