      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いつもより、身だしなみや\r\n言葉遣いに気をつけないとな。",
        "official_en": "I need not remind you that you must be particularly mindful of your appearance and decorum.",
        "real_en": "We’ll need to be more careful than usual about how we look and speak."
      },
